---
import Link from '../components/Link.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	profile
	title="About"
	description="Who runs Unbeholden, what it runs on, and why the data stays here."
>
	<h1 class="page-title mb-10">
		I'm Jakub. I self-host what I can, and run open source where a good option exists.
	</h1>
	<div class="callout page-panel">
		<p class="standfirst">
			I've never found a good reason to hand photos and mail to a company when I don't have to.
			Convenience is the only argument for it, and running it myself has cost less than I expected.
		</p>
		<p class="text-dim mt-6">
			I host <Link href="https://umami.is" class="link">Umami</Link> to see which entries get read. It sets no
			cookies, and the data stays on the server.
		</p>
		<p class="text-dim mt-6">
			When something I need doesn't exist, or only exists as a service someone could take away, I
			write it and publish it here. It's usually small and solves one specific problem.
		</p>
		<p class="text-dim mt-6">
			If any of it is useful, copy it. You may find something you didn't know you could run
			yourself.
		</p>
		<p class="text-dim mt-6">
			Professional experience and a downloadable PDF are on <a href="/cv" class="link">the CV page</a>.
		</p>
		<h2 class="heading-2 mt-12">The setup</h2>
		<ul class="text-dim mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
			<li>A rented VPS: this site and <Link href="https://stalw.art" class="link">Stalwart</Link> for mail, behind <Link href="https://dokploy.com" class="link">Dokploy</Link> and <Link href="https://traefik.io" class="link">Traefik</Link>. Outbound mail goes through <Link href="https://www.smtp2go.com" class="link">SMTP2Go</Link>.</li>
			<li>At home: a <Link href="https://www.proxmox.com" class="link">Proxmox</Link> host with LXC containers, among them <Link href="https://forgejo.org" class="link">Forgejo</Link> and the agents' dev containers, plus <Link href="https://bitcoincore.org" class="link">Bitcoin Core</Link>, <Link href="https://github.com/lightningnetwork/lnd" class="link">LND</Link> and the <Link href="https://github.com/unbeholdendev/lnurl-server" class="link">Lightning Address server</Link>.</li>
			<li>Between them, a tailnet managed by <Link href="https://headscale.net" class="link">Headscale</Link>.</li>
			<li>Also self-hosted: <Link href="https://listmonk.app" class="link">Listmonk</Link> for the subscription list, <Link href="https://ntfy.sh" class="link">ntfy</Link> for notifications, <Link href="https://umami.is" class="link">Umami</Link> for analytics.</li>
		</ul>
		<p class="text-dim mt-10">Prose is CC BY 4.0. Code is CC0/MIT.</p>
	</div>
</Layout>
